{
  "info": {
    "name": "Kamerinos SPA API",
    "description": "Colección de pruebas para la API de Kamerinos SPA Bogotá.\n\nFlujo recomendado:\n1. Login Admin → guarda accessToken\n2. Crear servicios → prueba sitio público\n3. Registrar cliente + login → prueba /agendar (crear cita)\n4. Admin: confirmar cita, completar, cancelar, revertir (reopen)\n\nSeed automático (RUN_SEED=true): admin@sandrapinzonsaludybelleza.com.co / admin123 + 8 categorías + 8 servicios + 8 productos.\n\nNota: los endpoints list devuelven PaginatedResult { data, total, page, limit, totalPages } — los scripts usan json.data.\n\nÚltima actualización: Agosto 2026 — 64 requests.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Cliente",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('clientAccessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('clientRefreshToken', json.refreshToken);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"cliente@test.com\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Maria\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Gomez\",\n  \"phone\": \"3001234567\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            }
          }
